{"hits": {"hits": [{"created": "2026-10-17T16:57:54.532142+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-17T16:57:54.941306+00:00", "id": 23439582, "conceptrecid": "23439581", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23439582", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23439581", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23439582", "metadata": {"title": "Vanishing of the cellularization map for non-p-nilpotent component groups", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23439582", "publication_date": "2026-10-17", "description": "<p>For every prime p, every field k of characteristic p, and every compact Lie group G whose component group is not p-nilpotent, the canonical k-cellularization map of C_*(Omega((BG)^p-completed);k) induces zero on every homotopy group. This gives an affirmative answer to Greenlees's Question 2.2 in Oberwolfach Report 9/2026. Completion is taken before looping; no adjoint-orientability, nilpotent-action or spectral-sequence-collapse hypothesis is imposed. The proof combines classical proxy-smallness and finite-ideal results for Hopf algebras through a class-by-class compact approximation.</p><p>Four-page research note with TeX source, independent mathematical and priority audits, exact bounded algebra convention checks and reproduction instructions. AI tools were used extensively in development, verification and writing. Unrefereed; no external human peer review or formal proof-assistant certification is claimed. The conclusion is homotopy vanishing, not nullity in the derived category. Constituent classical results and known restricted cases are credited; the priority audit is bounded.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Kriebel, Alec", "affiliation": "Independent researcher", "orcid": "0009-0001-9320-500X"}], "keywords": ["algebraic topology", "compact Lie groups", "cellularization", "Hopf algebras", "proxy-smallness", "p-completion", "Greenlees Question 2.2"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.4171/owr/2026/9", "relation": "references", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1112/blms.70405", "relation": "references", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/pull/1102", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "1.0.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23439581"}}]}}, "title": "Vanishing of the cellularization map for non-p-nilpotent component groups", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23439582", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23439582?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23439582", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23439582", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23439582", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439581", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23439581", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23439581", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23439581", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23439582/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23439582/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23439582:cellularization-vanishing.pdf/full/%5E10,/0/default.jpg", "50": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23439582:cellularization-vanishing.pdf/full/%5E50,/0/default.jpg", "100": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23439582:cellularization-vanishing.pdf/full/%5E100,/0/default.jpg", "250": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23439582:cellularization-vanishing.pdf/full/%5E250,/0/default.jpg", "750": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23439582:cellularization-vanishing.pdf/full/%5E750,/0/default.jpg", "1200": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23439582:cellularization-vanishing.pdf/full/%5E1200,/0/default.jpg"}, "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23439582/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/requests"}, "updated": "2026-10-17T16:57:54.941306+00:00", "recid": "23439582", "revision": 3, "files": [{"id": "eae722fa-eebd-4a51-9a78-a14d1c04fbab", "key": "cellularization-vanishing-source-and-verification.zip", "size": 109403, "checksum": "md5:694c340b5f50e347382cd0c8447672d3", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/files/cellularization-vanishing-source-and-verification.zip/content"}}, {"id": "f1a60a1a-ede0-4aeb-8337-ecccf10ab62e", "key": "cellularization-vanishing.pdf", "size": 69097, "checksum": "md5:ddcd551529754cc68acf981c4d613f24", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23439582/files/cellularization-vanishing.pdf/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "1789874"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 11, "uniqu